    <bpmn:process id="W_W3811" name="W3811. TESDA Program Registration, Dual-Training &amp; Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Charter (W3809); registration cycle; regulatory change
Frequency: On registration + maintained
Volume: TESDA-registered program(s)
Owner: Trade Capability / Compliance
Participants: Trade Capability, Compliance (links to VS-22), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Records (links to VS-88), TESDA
Source: workflow W3811 — TESDA Program Registration, Dual-Training &amp; Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3811_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3811_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3811_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3811_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3811_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3811_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3811_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3811_Start3" name="Charter (W3809); registration cycle; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3811_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3811_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Compliance register BuildRight&#x27;s apprenticeship/dual-training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Compliance register BuildRight&#x27;s apprenticeship/dual-training program with TESDA per RA 7796 and the dual-training-system (DTS) rules: program documentation, competency standards (links to W3810), facility/instructor qualification, and TESDA approval/registration
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: On registration</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3811_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3811_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3811_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Compliance manage ongoing TESDA compliance: program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Compliance manage ongoing TESDA compliance: program audit/readiness, instructor/assessor qualification (links to W3828), assessment-center accreditation where applicable, and reporting to TESDA
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Compliance
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3811_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3811_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3811_Task6" name="Trade Capability/Records/Legal manage the dual-training agreements…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability/Records/Legal manage the dual-training agreements (BuildRight–apprentice–school for DTS), compliance documentation, and records retention (links to VS-88), and support TESDA inspection (links to VS-22.2)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Records / Legal
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3811_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3811_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3811_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
