    <bpmn:process id="W_W3812" name="W3812. Apprenticeship Funding, Stipend &amp; DOLE Labor Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Charter (W3809); annual budget (links to VS-33.1)
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Apprenticeship program budget &amp; stipend
Owner: Trade Capability / Finance / HR
Participants: Trade Capability, Finance (links to VS-17.4), HR (links to VS-19/VS-102), Compensation (links to VS-102), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Compliance (links to VS-22), DOLE
Source: workflow W3812 — Apprenticeship Funding, Stipend &amp; DOLE Labor Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3812_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3812_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3812_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3812_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3812_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3812_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3812_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3812_Start3" name="Charter (W3809); annual budget (links to VS-33.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3812_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3812_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Finance/HR design the apprenticeship funding model: apprentice…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Finance/HR design the apprenticeship funding model: apprentice stipend/allowance (within DOLE apprenticeship/dual-training rules), training cost, tool/PPE/kit cost (links to W172), certification fees, and instructor cost; align to budget (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Finance / Compensation
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3812_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
