        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/TA-Marketing market and recruit apprentices: employer-brand campaign for apprenticeship (links to VS-121 W3761/W3763), sourcing from vocational schools/TESDA partners (links to W3826) and the community, and inclusive outreach (women in trades, regional — links to VS-103.2)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / TA Marketing
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
