    <bpmn:process id="W_W3816" name="W3816. Apprenticeship Program Continuous Improvement &amp; Curriculum Refresh" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; outcome analytics (links to W3832); product/category change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Program improvement cycle
Owner: Trade Capability / L&amp;D
Participants: Trade Capability, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Master Tradespersons (links to W3828), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Quality (links to VS-31), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3816 — Apprenticeship Program Continuous Improvement &amp; Curriculum Refresh</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3816_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3816_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3816_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3816_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3816_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3816_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3816_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3816_Start3" name="Annual review; outcome analytics (links to W3832); product/category change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3816_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3816_Task4" name="Trade Capability/L&amp;D review program outcomes (completion, certification…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/L&amp;D review program outcomes (completion, certification, placement, retention, service-quality uplift — links to W3832), gather apprentice/mentor/store feedback, and identify improvement themes
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / L&amp;D / Analytics
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3816_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3816_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3816_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Master-Tradespersons refresh curriculum and standards for new…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Master-Tradespersons refresh curriculum and standards for new products/categories/methods (links to VS-01.1 assortment, VS-09 services), and update TESDA registration where standards change (links to W3811)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Master Tradespersons / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3816_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3816_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3816_Task6" name="Trade Capability implement improvements, communicate to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability implement improvements, communicate to instructors/mentors/stores (links to W3828/W3821), and track the impact in the next outcome cycle (links to W3832)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3816_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3816_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3816_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3816_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-598 (ensure controlled execution — Apprenticeship Program Design, TESDA Registration &amp; Governance (PA-123.1).) | - operational: annual refresh; operational: outcome analytics
Owner: Trade Capability / L&amp;D</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
